ore  than 55 percent in the past eight years  they say the problem is efficiency not  money the capacities for a conventional  war in  the european nato member states doubles  that of russia so there's already  deterrence  and so like this kind of arm spending is  not gonna gonna lead to a more peaceful  world on the contrary it's gonna  escalate a global arms race  despite these warnings germany says it's  committed to being an important nato  partner in the heart of europe that  other nations can rely on staff fasten  al jazeera berlin
 

